ssue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98801","id":2454945293,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SU34N","user":{"login":"zeux","id":1106629,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDY2Mjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1106629?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux","html_url":"https://github.com/zeux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T15:00:56Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T15:04:34Z","body":"> (Trading off using more video memory, but this shouldn't be much in the case of lower LODs.)\r\n\r\nWhile this is a possibility, it would be a very substantial vertex memory increase overall - more than 2x in some cases with the current code. You could restrict the copying to just the last LOD perhaps, but with this optimization the efficiency of the last LOD is maximized anyhow.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2454945293/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455525535","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98801#issuecomment-2455525535","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98801","id":2455525535,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SXFif","user":{"login":"zeux","id":1106629,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDY2Mjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1106629?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux","html_url":"https://github.com/zeux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T19:25:53Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T19:25:53Z","body":"Also tested on a variant of the scene from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/93587 (without artificial 8x duplication, so just 100 models) from this view:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7cf108ea-8b3b-405d-a2e7-cdcf2112974a)\r\n\r\nBefore: GPU time 0.64ms normal, 1.84ms disable LOD; import time 25.9s\r\nAfter: GPU time 0.56ms normal, 1.78ms disable LOD; import time 25.9s (~unchanged)\r\n\r\nDue to the refactoring, the optimization cost is now isolated and more clearly visible in the profiler:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a39bbc4-95c6-4cec-8843-13332b64f8b5)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455525535/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":5,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/